From: Junction 2026 team <junction2026@localhost>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:28:33 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] fix(backend): say when a dataset will not record a
 session's camera or depth

A dataset records the cameras it was first recorded with, so a RealSense
switched to "Color + depth" after the dataset's first episodes silently
recorded no depth. Loading such a dataset now reports which cameras and depth
maps will not be recorded, and to record into a new dataset to keep them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
